summary: Remove all generated files from Kdump tests.
description: |
    It removes all timestamps, temporary files and vmcores from previous
    test cases. It is often run as the last step in a test case, so the
    machine would be ready to run the next test case.
contact: Kdump QE <kdump-qe-list@redhat.com>
test: make run
framework: shell
require: 
  - kexec-tools
recommend: 
  - nfs
  - util-linux
  - NetworkManager
duration: 20m
extra-summary: /kernel/kdump/clean-up
extra-task: /kernel/kdump/clean-up